abstract: >-
  A synthetic nervous-system-shaped toy: 128 neurons in sensory,
  spinal, central and motor stages, enveloped phasor waves for
  four responses, outer-product holographic memory with a
  Youden's-J refusing gate, and measured reflex vs central
  routes plus a graph lesion control. v0.2.0 adds a chosen
  7.0 Hz frequency gate and a Crystallize injection on
  rejection. Stdlib-only.
